    {
      "id": "agent-body",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 568,
      "y": 968.0999999999999,
      "width": 445.262939453125,
      "height": 298.35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g9"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "ai",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 2131063406,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 182215858,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790839212234,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Stores chat history and customer memory: account,\nprior questions, open credit requests\n\n8 typed tools, inputs and outputs validated with zod:\ngetAccount, getInvoice, explainLineItem, compareInvoices,\nsimulatePlan, detectAnomalies, startCreditRequest,\ngetCreditRequestStatus\n\nGrounding guard: every amount, percent and count in a\nreply must appear in this turn's tool results\n(one retry, then unsupported sentences are removed)\nAnomaly check runs server-side on every invoice touched\nThe customer confirms before a credit request starts",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Stores chat history and customer memory: account,\nprior questions, open credit requests\n\n8 typed tools, inputs and outputs validated with zod:\ngetAccount, getInvoice, explainLineItem, compareInvoices,\nsimulatePlan, detectAnomalies, startCreditRequest,\ngetCreditRequestStatus\n\nGrounding guard: every amount, percent and count in a\nreply must appear in this turn's tool results\n(one retry, then unsupported sentences are removed)\nAnomaly check runs server-side on every invoice touched\nThe customer confirms before a credit request starts",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.35
    },
